<PageLayout title="Gemini vs TotalRecalls" description="Gemini official export vs. TotalRecalls." breadcrumbs={[{ label: "Compare", href: "/compare/" }, { label: "Gemini" }]}>
  <h1>Gemini vs. TotalRecalls</h1>
  <p>Google Takeout for Gemini gives you a raw JSON archive. TotalRecalls parses it into a structured, searchable library.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Official export:</strong> Google Takeout ZIP with conversations.json — no search, no Markdown.</li>
    <li><strong>TotalRecalls:</strong> Markdown + JSON with model names, timestamps, and metadata.</li>
  </ul>
</PageLayout>
